-- Delaware General Corporation Law, 8 Del. C. ch. 1 -- piece dg9, LAYER 1: Subchapter XI, sections 291 to 303.
-- Insolvency; receivers and trustees: appointment and powers; title to property; notices; inventory; proofs of
-- claim; adjudication and appeal; sale of perishable property; compensation; substitution; wage lien;
-- discontinuance of liquidation; compromise or arrangement; proceedings under the Federal Bankruptcy Code.
