    `itemized inventory of all the assets of the corporation` IS A BOOLEAN
    `statement of the nature of the assets` IS A BOOLEAN
    `statement of the probable value of the assets` IS A BOOLEAN
    `account of all debts due from the corporation` IS A BOOLEAN
    `account of all debts due to the corporation` IS A BOOLEAN

