@ref 8 Del. C. § 294 (src:1537)
GIVEN `the inventory` IS A `s 294 Inventory`
      `the inventory is filed in the office of the Register in Chancery of the county in which the proceeding is pending` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`s 294 the inventory is full and complete and filed as the section requires` MEANS
        `the inventory is filed in the office of the Register in Chancery of the county in which the proceeding is pending`
    AND `the inventory`'s `itemized inventory of all the assets of the corporation`
    AND `the inventory`'s `statement of the nature of the assets`
    AND `the inventory`'s `statement of the probable value of the assets`
    AND `the inventory`'s `account of all debts due from the corporation`
    AND `the inventory`'s `account of all debts due to the corporation`

-- "They shall make a report to the Court of their proceedings, whenever and as often as the Court shall direct."
-- src:1537 | They shall make a report to the Court of their proceedings, whenever and as often as the Court shall direct.
@ref 8 Del. C. § 294 (src:1537)
GIVEN `the Court of Chancery has directed a report on this occasion` IS A BOOLEAN
