GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`s 296(a) the creditor whose claim is disputed must submit to the examination` MEANS
    `the creditor’s claim is disputed` AND `the trustee or receiver has directed an examination in relation to the claim`

@ref 8 Del. C. § 296(a) (src:1545)
GIVEN `the creditor’s claim is disputed` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the trustee or receiver has required the production of books and papers relating to the claim` IS A BOOLEAN
